WEBVTT

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:02.223
but I didn't know that
and didn't pay much attention to that,

00:05:02.247 --> 00:05:04.522
and I was with one
of my Sunday school teachers.

00:05:04.546 --> 00:05:06.470
I drank out of the wrong water fountain,

00:05:06.494 --> 00:05:09.318
and she jerked me away,
and I didn't know what had happened,

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:12.082
and then she explained to me
about black and white water.

00:05:12.106 --> 00:05:13.813
I didn't know that, and after that,

00:05:13.837 --> 00:05:16.551
I went home, took my little
wounded psyche to my parents,

00:05:16.575 --> 00:05:19.749
and told them what had happened,
and said, "What's wrong with me?"

00:05:19.773 --> 00:05:21.989
And they said,
"It wasn't much wrong with you.

00:05:22.013 --> 00:05:23.683
It's what's wrong with the system."

00:05:23.703 --> 00:05:26.191
And I used to go then secretly
and switch water signs

00:05:26.205 --> 00:05:27.284
everywhere I went.

00:05:27.308 --> 00:05:28.309
(Laughter)

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:29.733
And it felt so good.

00:05:29.757 --> 00:05:32.289
(Applause)